the integration package hydram3-vlm/. The repository's own work is licensed under the Apache License
2.0 (see LICENSE). Both upstream projects are also licensed under the Apache License 2.0; their
license and notice files are kept unchanged in their directories.

1. M3: Matryoshka Multimodal Models (matryoshka-mm/)
   https://github.com/mu-cai/matryoshka-mm  (revision ec30cd3)
   Cai, Yang, Gao, Lee. ICLR 2025. Based on LLaVA, Copyright 2023 Haotian Liu.
   hydram3-vlm/src/hydram3/adapters/m3.py re-implements
   LlavaMetaForCausalLM.matryoshka_vis_token_process from llava/model/llava_arch.py (Apache-2.0).
   License: matryoshka-mm/LICENSE

2. HydraLLM (hydrallm/)
   https://github.com/tuhh-ncps/hydrallm  (revision 64c15ff)
   Kemme, Haberer, Hojjat, Landsiedel. BabyLM workshop 2026.
   hydram3-vlm uses it unmodified from its directory; no source copied into hydram3-vlm.
